title: "Per-tag handoffs: write, merge on read, init"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: refused
    lg1: session
    lg2: rest
  }
  class lg0 pink
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 teal
  s0: No handoffs yet
  s1: In session, merged view read
  s2: Handoffs at rest
  s3: Write refused, nothing written
  s4: In session, board moved since read
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an AI starts and reads the merged view and the board
  s1 --> s2: a write AI writes its own handoff last or a read-only AI leaves, writing nothing
  s1 --> s3: an AI tries to write another AI's handoff
  s1 --> s0: a read-only AI leaves, writing nothing
  s1 --> s4: a write AI patches the board it read or an AI starts and reads the merged view and the board
  s2 --> s1: an AI starts and reads the merged view and the board
  s3 --> s1: an AI starts and reads the merged view and the board or a write AI patches the board it read or a write AI writes its own handoff last or a read-only AI leaves, writing nothing
  s3 --> s2: a write AI writes its own handoff last or a read-only AI leaves, writing nothing
  s3 --> s0: a read-only AI leaves, writing nothing
  s3 --> s4: a write AI patches the board it read or an AI starts and reads the merged view and the board or a write AI writes its own handoff last or a read-only AI leaves, writing nothing
  s4 --> s1: a write AI writes its own handoff last or a read-only AI leaves, writing nothing
  s4 --> s3: an AI tries to write another AI's handoff or a patch on a moved board is refused
  s2 --> s4: an AI starts and reads the merged view and the board
  s4 --> s2: a write AI writes its own handoff last or a read-only AI leaves, writing nothing
  class s0 teal
  class s1 blue
  class s2 teal
  class s3 pink
  class s4 blue
